---
source: crates/runtime/tests/models/search.rs
description: "SELECT id, answer FROM text_search(qs, 'second') order by _score desc LIMIT 4"
---
+---------------+------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| plan_type     | plan                                                                                                                                                 |
+---------------+------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| logical_plan  | Projection: text_search(qs, Utf8("second")).id, text_search(qs, Utf8("second")).answer                                                               |
|               |   Sort: text_search(qs, Utf8("second"))._score DESC NULLS FIRST, fetch=4                                                                             |
|               |     Projection: text_search(qs, Utf8("second")).id, text_search(qs, Utf8("second")).answer, text_search(qs, Utf8("second"))._score                   |
|               |       TableScan: text_search(qs, Utf8("second")) projection=[_score, answer, id]                                                                     |
| physical_plan | ProjectionExec: expr=[id@0 as id, answer@1 as answer]                                                                                                |
|               |   ProjectionExec: expr=[id@2 as id, answer@1 as answer, _score@0 as _score]                                                                          |
|               |     ProjectionExec: expr=[_score@1 as _score, answer@2 as answer, id@0 as id]                                                                        |
|               |       SortExec: TopK(fetch=4), expr=[_score@1 DESC NULLS LAST, id@0 ASC], preserve_partitioning=[false]                                              |
|               |         HashJoinExec: mode=CollectLeft, join_type=Inner, accumulator=MinMaxLeftAccumulator, on=[(id@0, id@1)], projection=[id@0, _score@1, answer@2] |
|               |           CoalescePartitionsExec                                                                                                                     |
|               |             CooperativeExec                                                                                                                          |
|               |               BytesProcessedExec                                                                                                                     |
|               |                 RepartitionExec: partitioning=RoundRobinBatch(3), input_partitions=1                                                                 |
|               |                   FullTextSearchTableExec q=second, limit=1000                                                                                       |
|               |           SchemaCastScanExec                                                                                                                         |
|               |             CayenneAccelerationExec: snapshots_scanned=0, files_scanned=0                                                                            |
|               |               BytesProcessedExec                                                                                                                     |
|               |                 DataSourceExec: partitions=1, partition_sizes=[2]                                                                                    |
